| Page up | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(10) |
| Page down | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(-10) |

