### void QGraphicsAnchorLayout::setSpacing([qreal](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtglobal.html#qreal-typedef) *spacing*)

Sets the default horizontal and the default vertical spacing for the anchor layout to
*spacing*.

If an item is anchored with no spacing associated with the anchor, it will use the
default spacing.

[QGraphicsAnchorLayout](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsanchorlayout.html)
does not support negative spacings. Setting a negative value will unset the previous
spacing and make the layout use the spacing provided by the current widget style.

