### `[protected]` void QGraphicsLayout::addChildLayoutItem([QGraphicsLayoutItem](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicslayoutitem.html#QGraphicsLayoutItem) \\**layoutItem*)

This function is a convenience function provided for custom layouts, and will go through
all items in the layout and reparent their graphics items to the closest
[QGraphicsWidget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/graphicsview.html#qgraphicswidget)
