### `[slot]` void QGraphicsScene::invalidate(const [QRectF](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrectf.html) \\&*rect* \\= QRectF(), [QGraphicsScene::SceneLayers](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html#SceneLayer-enum) *layers* \\= AllLayers)

Invalidates and schedules a redraw of the *layers* in *rect* on the scene. Any cached
content in *layers* is unconditionally invalidated and redrawn.

You can use this function overload to notify
[QGraphicsScene](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html) of changes to
the background or the foreground of the scene. This function is commonly used for scenes
with tile-based backgrounds to notify changes when
[QGraphicsView](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html) has enabled
[CacheBackground](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#CacheModeFlag-enum).

Example:

```
QRectF TileScene::rectForTile(int x, int y) const
{
    // Return the rectangle for the tile at position (x, y).
    return QRectF(x * tileWidth, y * tileHeight, tileWidth, tileHeight);
}

void TileScene::setTile(int x, int y, const QPixmap &pixmap)
{
    // Sets or replaces the tile at position (x, y) with pixmap.
    if (x >= 0 && x < numTilesH && y >= 0 && y < numTilesV) {
        tiles[y][x] = pixmap;
        invalidate(rectForTile(x, y), BackgroundLayer);
    }
}

void TileScene::drawBackground(QPainter *painter, const QRectF &exposed)
{
    // Draws all tiles that intersect the exposed area.
    for (int y = 0; y < numTilesV; ++y) {
        for (int x = 0; x < numTilesH; ++x) {
            QRectF rect = rectForTile(x, y);
            if (exposed.intersects(rect))
                painter->drawPixmap(rect.topLeft(), tiles[y][x]);
        }
    }
}
```

Note that [QGraphicsView](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html)
currently supports background caching only (see
[QGraphicsView::CacheBackground](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#CacheModeFlag-enum)).
This function is equivalent to calling
[update](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html#update)() if any layer
but
[BackgroundLayer](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html#SceneLayer-enum)
is passed.

**See also**
[QGraphicsView::resetCachedContent](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#resetCachedContent)().

