[selectedItems](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html#selectedItems)().

*deviceTransform* is the transformation that applies to the view, and needs to be
provided if the scene contains items that ignore transformations.

For an item to be selected, it must be marked as *selectable*
([QGraphicsItem::ItemIsSelectable](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsitem.html#GraphicsItemFlag-enum)).

This function was introduced in Qt 4.6.

