to deliver [Move](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qevent.html#Type-enum) events, and
[ItemParentChange](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsitem.html#GraphicsItemChange-enum)
both to deliver [ParentChange](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qevent.html#Type-enum)
events, and for managing the focus chain.

