Returns a list of all subwindows in the MDI area. If *order* is
[CreationOrder](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmdiarea.html#WindowOrder-enum) (the
default), the windows are sorted in the order in which they were inserted into the
workspace. If *order* is
[StackingOrder](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmdiarea.html#WindowOrder-enum), the
windows are listed in their stacking order, with the topmost window as the last item in
the list. If *order* is
[ActivationHistoryOrder](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmdiarea.html#WindowOrder-enum),
the windows are listed according to their recent activation history.

**See also**
[WindowOrder](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmdiarea.html#WindowOrder-enum).

