This sets the given *widget* to be shown directly on the left of the first menu item, or
on the right of the last menu item, depending on *corner*.

The menu bar takes ownership of *widget*, reparenting it into the menu bar. However, if
the *corner* already contains a widget, this previous widget will no longer be managed
and will still be a visible child of the menu bar.

