### [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) QPageSize::key() const

Returns the unique key of the page size.

By default this is the PPD standard mediaOption keyword for the page size, or the PPD
custom format key. If the [QPageSize](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpagesize.html)
instance was obtained from a print device then this will be the key provided by the
print device and may differ from the standard key.

If the [QPageSize](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpagesize.html) is invalid then
the key will be an empty string.

This key should never be shown to end users, it is an internal key only. For a
