Set the page *margins* in the current page layout units.

You should call this before calling
[QPainter::begin](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpainter.html#begin)(), or
immediately before calling
[newPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpagedpaintdevice.html#newPage)() to apply
