to setPageMargins() and
[newPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpagedpaintdevice.html#newPage)() as the
wrong paint metrics may be used.

To get the current page margins use
[pageLayout](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpagedpaintdevice.html#pageLayout)().margins().

Returns true if the page margins were successfully set to *margins*.

This function was introduced in Qt 5.3.

