### `[slot]` void QPaintDeviceWindow::update()

Marks the entire window as dirty and schedules a repaint.

**Note:** Subsequent calls to this function before the next paint event will get
ignored.

**Note:** For non-exposed windows the update is deferred until the window becomes
exposed again.

