### `[slot]` void QProgressDialog::setRange(int *minimum*, int *maximum*)

Sets the progress dialog's minimum and maximum values to *minimum* and *maximum*,
respectively.

If *maximum* is smaller than *minimum*, *minimum* becomes the only legal value.

If the current value falls outside the new range, the progress dialog is reset with
[reset](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qprogressdialog.html#reset)().

