### `[protected]` void QSplitterHandle::moveSplitter(int *pos*)

Tells the splitter to move this handle to position *pos*, which is the distance from the
left or top edge of the widget.

Note that *pos* is also measured from the left (or top) for right-to-left languages.
This function will map *pos* to the appropriate position before calling
[QSplitter::moveSplitter](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qsplitter.html#moveSplitter)().

