*widget* that is returned).

If the [QStackedLayout](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstackedlayout.html) is empty
before this function is called, the given *widget* becomes the current widget.

Inserting a new widget at an index less than or equal to the current index will
increment the current index, but keep the current widget.

