### `[protected]` void QSyntaxHighlighter::setFormat(int *start*, int *count*, const [QTextCharFormat](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtextcharformat.html) \\&*format*)

This function is applied to the syntax highlighter's current text block (i.e. the text
that is passed to the
[highlightBlock](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qsyntaxhighlighter.html#highlightBlock)()
function).

The specified *format* is applied to the text from the *start* position for a length of
