identifiers. *type* should be a value from
[QTextDocument::ResourceType](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtextdocument.html#ResourceType-enum).

For example, you can add an image as a resource in order to reference it from within the
document:

```
    document->addResource(QTextDocument::ImageResource,
