### void QTextDocument::setHtml(const [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) \\&*html*)

Replaces the entire contents of the document with the given HTML-formatted text in the
*html* string. The undo/redo history is reset when this function is called.

