### `[slot]` void QTextEdit::insertHtml(const [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) \\&*text*)

Convenience slot that inserts *text* which is assumed to be of html formatting at the
current cursor position.

It is equivalent to:

```
edit->textCursor().insertHtml(fragment);
```

**Note:** When using this function with a style sheet, the style sheet will only apply
to the current block in the document. In order to apply a style sheet throughout a
document, use
