Sets the text of the item at position *index* to *text*.

If the provided text contains an ampersand character ('\\&'), a mnemonic is automatically
created for it. The character that follows the '\\&' will be used as the shortcut key.
Any previous mnemonic will be overwritten, or cleared if no mnemonic is defined by the
text. See the [QShortcut](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qshortcut.html#mnemonic)
documentation for details (to display an actual ampersand, use '\\&\\&').

