**Note:** On platforms that support scrolling
[phases](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwheelevent.html#phase), the delta may be
null when:

- scrolling is about to begin, but the distance did not yet change ([Qt::ScrollBegin](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qt.html#ScrollPhase-enum)),
