the
[Qt::WA\\_QuitOnClose](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qt.html#WidgetAttribute-enum)
attribute set is closed. By default this attribute is set for all widgets except
transient windows such as splash screens, tool windows, and popup menus.

