    'Qt 5 reference:\n\n### subTitle : [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html)\n\nThis property holds the subtitle of the page\n\nThe subtitle is shown by the [QWizard](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html),\nbetween the title and the actual page. Subtitles are optional. In\n[ClassicStyle](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#WizardStyle-enum) and\n[ModernStyle](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#WizardStyle-enum), using\nsubtitles is necessary to make the header appear. In\n[MacStyle](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#WizardStyle-enum), the\nsubtitle is shown as a text label just above the actual page.\n\nThe subtitle may be plain text or HTML, depending on the value of the\n[QWizard::subTitleFormat](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#subTitleFormat-prop)\nproperty.\n\nBy default, this property contains an empty string.\n\n**Access functions:**\n\n| QString | **subTitle**() const |\n| --- | --- |\n| void | **setSubTitle**(const QString \\&*subTitle*) |\n\n**See also** [title](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#title-prop),\n[QWizard::IgnoreSubTitles](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#WizardOption-enum),\nand [Elements of a Wizard\nPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#elements-of-a-wizard-page).\n\nSource: https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#subTitle'
    tabletTracking: Any
    title: str
    'Qt 5 reference:\n\n### title : [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html)\n\nThis property holds the title of the page\n\nThe title is shown by the [QWizard](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html),\nabove the actual page. All pages should have a title.\n\nThe title may be plain text or HTML, depending on the value of the\n[QWizard::titleFormat](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#titleFormat-prop)\nproperty.\n\nBy default, this property contains an empty string.\n\n**Access functions:**\n\n| QString | **title**() const |\n| --- | --- |\n| void | **setTitle**(const QString \\&*title*) |\n\n**See also**\n[subTitle](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#subTitle-prop) and\n[Elements of a Wizard\nPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizard.html#elements-of-a-wizard-page).\n\nSource: https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#title'
